  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.310" end="00:01.810" ttm:agent="v1">Do you like waffles?</p>
      <p begin="00:01.570" end="00:03.070" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, we like waffles!</p>
      <p begin="00:02.610" end="00:04.110" ttm:agent="v1">Do you like pancakes?</p>
      <p begin="00:03.860" end="00:05.360" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, we like pancakes!</p>
      <p begin="00:05.080" end="00:06.580" ttm:agent="v1">Do you like French toasts?</p>
      <p begin="00:06.290" end="00:07.790" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, we like French toasts!</p>
      <p begin="00:07.470" end="00:09.510" ttm:agent="v1">Do-do-do-do, can't wait to get a mouthful</p>
      <p begin="00:09.510" end="00:17.030" ttm:agent="v1">Waffles, waffles, waffles, waffles!</p>
      <p begin="00:17.030" end="00:19.310" ttm:agent="v1">Do-do-do-do, can't wait to get a mouthful</p>
      <p begin="00:19.310" end="00:20.810" ttm:agent="v1">Do you like waffles?</p>
      <p begin="00:20.510" end="00:22.010" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, we like waffles!</p>
      <p begin="00:21.780" end="00:23.280" ttm:agent="v1">Do you like pancakes?</p>
      <p begin="00:22.900" end="00:24.400" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, we like pancakes!</p>
      <p begin="00:24.150" end="00:25.650" ttm:agent="v1">Do you like French toast?</p>
      <p begin="00:25.350" end="00:26.850" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, we like French toast!</p>
      <p begin="00:26.450" end="00:28.410" ttm:agent="v1">Do-do-do-do, can't wait to get a mouthful</p>
      <p begin="00:28.410" end="00:32.410" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
